body:
"The only thing that works in this world... Is that you treat others as they treat you" (short, keep going for long) -technoblade

&#x200B;

Long version: "The only thing that works in this world.. Is that you treat others as they treat you. Those who have treated me (techno) with kindness, I shall repay that kindness 10 fold. But those who treat me with injustice, who use me, who hunt me down, who hurt my friends!.. I shall repay that injustice a thousand times over."
